 the county&rsquo;s 6 grids runs 75 years, and November to December came in under 90% of normal in 38 of them, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle saw January to February at 30% of normal and August to September at 32%. Grid 24167 had its driest year in 2025 at 63% of normal. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 167% on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
